Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.07,0:00:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Your aircraft has a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.51,0:00:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's a sneak peek at what's next for\NMyTailLog.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.55,0:00:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow decades of maintenance across every\Nlogbook,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.16,0:00:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,on one connected map.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.09,0:00:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Check what was read, right beside the original\Npage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.10,0:00:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Your review keeps the records in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.06,0:00:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Native iPhone and Android apps are coming\Nsoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.44,0:00:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep aircraft details close, and queue updates\Noffline.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.19,0:00:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And on iPhone Duo, move from the cover\Nscreen to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.56,0:00:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,a spacious view, with records side by side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.09,0:00:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Track hours, oil and squawks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.32,0:00:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Connect MyFlightBook, and share the records\Nthat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.65,0:00:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.89,0:00:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Free and open source.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.23,0:00:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Try the new design on the web today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.32,0:00:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Native apps are coming soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.29,0:00:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Explore MyTailLog dot com.
